p":"/whitepaper/digital-transformation-islamic-banking-whitepaper"},{"s":"2025/04/Gartner-image_Sohini-Bhattacharya-768x347.jpg","t":"Azentio recognized as a Representative Vendor in Gartner\u00ae Market Guide for Life and P&C Insurance Core Systems, APAC","p":""},{"s":"2024/07/49-Azentio-triumphs-at-IBSi-SLT-2024-768x347.jpg","t":"Azentio triumphs at IBSi SLT 2024","p":""},{"s":"2024/04/51-wins-big-at-ibsi-global-fintech-innovation-768x347.jpg","t":"Azentio wins big at ibsi global fintech innovation awards 2024","p":""},{"s":"2024/01/56-Empowering-clients-for-growth-768x347.jpg","t":"Empowering clients for growth","p":""},{"s":"2026/09/GCC_Lending_thumbnailimage-1-768x347.webp","t":"GCC lending operating models: Closing the Readiness Gap","p":""},{"s":"2026/04/UAE-e-invoicing-compliance-768x347.webp","t":"UAE E-Invoicing is coming: Five priorities CFOs should act on now","p":""},{"s":"2026/04/Gartner-2026_thumbnail-ERP-768x347.webp","t":"Azentio recognized in the 2026 Gartner\u00ae Peer Insights\u00ae Voice of the Customer for Cloud ERP for Product-Centric Enterprises","p":""},{"s":"2025/12/Miles-Rent-A-Car-1-768x347.webp","t":"Miles Rent A Car boosts operational excellence in Saudi Arabia with Azentio ERP","p":""},{"s":"2026/05/ai-in-insurance-operations-768x347.webp","t":"The future insurer: Built for AI, ready for change","p":""},{"s":"2026/02/Azentio-Blog-Thumbnails-768x347.webp","t":"Azentio recognized in Celent\u2019s P&C Policy Administration Systems reports for APAC and EMEA (2025)","p":""},{"s":"2025/12/IBSi-Global-Fintech-2025-768x347.webp","t":"Azentio secures four wins at the IBSi Global FinTech Innovation Awards (GFIA) 2025","p":""},{"s":"2025/09/Greenworld-ERP-story_image-768x347.webp","t":"Greenworld and Faza Home accelerate digital transformation across retail, distribution and real estate operations with Azentio ERP","p":""},{"s":"2026/05/kyc-compliance-software-for-banks-768x347.webp","t":"Azentio recognized in the QKS SPARK Matrix\u2122: Know Your Customer (KYC) 2026 report","p":""}],"testimonials":[{"q":"We were working with a legacy system that had many limitations. It was not flexible and could not support our transformation goals. With Azentio\u2019s lending solution we have seen a real shift with smoother processing, improved comfort for users and approvers, and a platform that aligns with our evolving business.","img":"2025/12/Syed-Nayyar-Rizvi_CEO_sahb.webp","n":"Syed Nayyar Rizvi","r":"CEO Advisor, sahb Finance"},{"q":"It\u2019s a big impact. We don\u2019t have to keep re-entering information from one document to the next. It\u2019s flowing from one place to another.","img":"2024/10/user-2.png","n":"Sanjay Sanghai","r":"Finance Manager, Emirates Printing Forms"},{"q":"As a leading Islamic bank, we are dedicated to providing unparalleled service to our customers by leveraging transformative technologies. The latest update to the iMAL core banking platform has enabled us to overcome key operational challenges and achieve substantial efficiency gains. These enhancements align perfectly with our commitment to innovation and customer-centric services, allowing us to serve our customers more effectively and advance our mission of providing best-in-class Islamic banking services.","img":"2025/12/abdulla-alkhuzam.webp","n":"Abdulla AlKhuzam","r":"Chief Information Officer, Boubyan Bank"},{"q":"Azentio has been a core enabler in our journey to becoming a digital first, Shari\u2019ah-compliant corporate bank. Their AAOIFI certification and seamless integration offerings have helped us launch on time and build a solid foundation for future expansion.","img":"2025/08/Parvin-Jain-VisionBank.webp","n":"Parvin Jain","r":"CEO, Vision Bank"},{"q":"As a digital microfinance institution in a regulated Shari\u2019ah-compliant setup, we needed a platform that could manage both speed and strict compliance. Azentio\u2019s Lending solution gave us that edge. It helped us automate process-heavy activities, stay ready for audits, and grow quickly without losing control.","img":"2025/12/Abdulrazaq_CTO_Tamam.webp","n":"Abdulrazaq Fuad Hindi","r":"CTO, Tamam Financing"},{"q":"Partnering with Azentio has helped us elevate our compliance framework with greater agility and precision. AMLOCK has complemented our existing practices by enabling faster decision-making and scalable risk monitoring while staying aligned with regulatory expectations. It has been a collaborative and future-focused engagement.","img":"2024/10/user-2.png","n":"Viral Turakhia","r":"Senior Vice President & Head of Risk, Razorpay"},{"q":"Azentio is very supportive. They take the time to understand your requirements and complete projects as if they were an extension of your internal IT team rather than another third-party vendor.","img":"2025/10/manish.png","n":"Manish Agarwal","r":"Chief Information Officer, M.H. Enterprises"},{"q":"The Azentio team demonstrated exceptional professionalism, deep understanding, and unwavering commitment throughout the project. Their support, collaborative approach, and strong project management ensured a smooth and timely implementation. We truly value the partnership and the positive transformation it has brought to our operations.","img":"2025/08/Surendranath_AncharazKiran_SICOM.webp","n":"Surendranath Ancharaz (Kiran)","r":"Senior Executive Officer, SICOM"},{"q":"We are incredibly grateful for the exceptional program management and execution that have enabled the successful implementation of critical modules, including Medical Core, Medical Customer Portal, Motor Core, Motor Tele Sale Portal, Motor Broker Portal, and Motor Customer Portal. This transformation has been a monumental effort, and the team\u2019s dedication and collaborative approach have been instrumental in driving progress. With timely interventions and continued support, we\u2019ve seen remarkable improvements and are confident in achieving our remaining goals. We highly commend the team\u2019s professionalism and commitment to delivering excellence under tight timelines.","img":"2025/01/NAJEEB_QIIC.webp","n":"Najeeb Haneefa","r":"Director Information Technology, Qatar Islamic Insurance Group"},{"q":"Azentio has been a core enabler in our journey to becoming a digital first, Shari\u2019ah-compliant corporate bank. Their AAOIFI certification and seamless integration offerings have helped us launch on time and build a solid foundation for future expansion.","img":"2025/08/Parvin-Jain-VisionBank.webp","n":"Parvin Jain","r":"CEO, Vision Bank"},{"q":"As our operations scaled, we knew our compliance processes needed to keep pace, not just in volume, but in precision and agility. Azentio helped us move from manual-intensive routines to a more intelligent, automated framework. It\u2019s made a real difference in how we manage risk, stay audit-ready, and deliver with confidence.","img":"2025/08/subhasish-maitra.webp","n":"Subhasish Maitra","r":"Head of IT, Bajaj Finance Limited"},{"q":"At BankIslami, we are committed to providing best-in-class services while driving aggressive nationwide expansion. To fuel our growth, we need solutions aligned with global trends and capable of supporting our vision. The iMAL R14 upgrade is a critical step forward, equipping us with the technology to enhance efficiency and continue delivering innovative, Shari\u2019ah-compliant financial solutions.","img":"2025/08/Rizwan_Ata_BankIslami.webp","n":"Rizwan Ata","r":"President & CEO, BankIslami"},{"q":"With Azentio, we\u2019ve achieved full Shari\u2019ah compliance while streamlining our operations and delivering transparent, efficient services to our customers. The solution has been a reliable backbone in our journey to scale and lead in Ethiopia\u2019s interest-free banking sector.","img":"2025/08/Daniel-Hailu_BOA.webp","n":"Daniel Hailu","r":"CIO, Bank of Abyssinia"},{"q":"Swan Zambia successfully implemented Azentio\u2019s Core Insurance Suite thereby enhancing its operational efficiency across all departments. The Suite streamlined processes, improved data accuracy, and provided a comprehensive view of operations. Its flexibility and scalability have supported our growth, and we are confident it will continue to drive success.","img":"2025/03/msy_sidhique.png","n":"Jean Fran\u00e7ois Cateaux","r":"Chief Executive Officer, Swan General Insurance Zambia Limited"},{"q":"In order to future-proof our operations and support our expansion goals, we knew we needed a solution that would allow us to seamlessly integrate all business functions while providing real-time data and insights. Azentio ERP delivers the scalability and flexibility required to adapt to evolving market conditions. The advanced capabilities of Azentio ERP have also notably improved speed and time management within the company with features such as user behaviour dashboards, data-driven alerts, and trigger notifications enabling real-time monitoring and proactive decision-making.","img":"2024/10/user-2.png","n":"P. K. Choudhary","r":"Managing Director, Hindustan Composites, India"},{"q":"In a rapidly changing industry, forward-looking enterprises are looking for ways to streamline efficiency, while maintaining product quality. Keeping lead times low seems increasingly difficult when you have global disruptions, a lack of supply chain visibility, and manual processes that bottleneck productivity. Further to multiple rounds of software evaluation, we believe Azentio ERP is the best-fit platform for our business challenges.","img":"2024/10/user-2.png","n":"Dr. Qutubuddin Saify","r":"Managing Director, Al Taher Chemicals Trading LLC., UAE"},{"q":"We are extremely pleased with the smooth implementation of Azentio ERP E-Invoicing solution. This upgrade aligns with our commitment to operational excellence and has significantly improved our invoicing processes, enabling us to adapt to Malaysia\u2019s digital economy swiftly.","img":"2024/10/user-2.png","n":"Chong Sok Chee","r":"VP Finance, Teik Senn, Malaysia"}],"